  "title": "Crawfish Thermidor",
  "description": "Individual servings of crawfish braised with fresh mushrooms in butter and white wine, then spiced with red pepper flakes. Great for an appetizer or as a side dish.",
  "authors": [
    "Kathleen Burton"
  ],
